d`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"f936bba363f68a6238a96102ad7aa687","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"63d74a53d198b4412698fa311a39b42f","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"2e6e09497aacb40f78b42dee8a6625ec","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"b3b410f75d0cb19dda92da5255cd462b","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"dbb29207e2eb620888b8014662399f0d","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"8220da0499016eb3cf4da4f65108338e","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"3813dd42ef72707cd84530b3036c93c7","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"d7296463cd8090fa6be1e8a1ad472f2c","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"63ae7940f4994fedfaf6c926030e12f9","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794843593578,"stop":1794843593682,"duration":104,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value"